WEBVTT

00:12:59.775 --> 00:13:02.945
but they do want influence
over their wages,

00:13:02.986 --> 00:13:04.154
working conditions

00:13:04.196 --> 00:13:07.449
and even the policies of their companies.

00:13:07.449 --> 00:13:10.077
And they are reimagining old approaches

00:13:10.118 --> 00:13:13.330
and coming up with new ones

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:16.208
in order to build worker voice and power.

00:13:17.292 --> 00:13:20.379
Some are reconfiguring
worker cooperatives:

00:13:20.379 --> 00:13:24.550
employee-owned businesses,

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:28.762
in which the workers determine wages,

00:13:28.804 --> 00:13:30.973
working conditions